WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Home keeps your next step close.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Scroll through places to discover, Atlas towns and handy tools.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Pick a self-guided city visit.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Read about each stop and track your progress.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Get directions to the next place.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Start from your location, an address or the previous stop.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.000
